IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sgi-ultra-vires`

-- Tests for sgi-ultra-vires.l4 (ss 25, 25A, 25B). Expected values are written from the text beside each assertion.

§ `s 25(1): not invalid by reason only of a lack of capacity or power`

-- An act of the company, the company lacked capacity, and that is the only ground: the text says it is not invalid by reason only of that fact (JUST FALSE).
#ASSERT `s 25(1) the act is invalid by reason only of the company's lack of capacity or power` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Another ground of invalidity is relied on: the subsection says nothing of it (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `s 25(1) the act is invalid by reason only of the company's lack of capacity or power` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The company did not lack capacity: the subsection is not engaged (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `s 25(1) the act is invalid by reason only of the company's lack of capacity or power` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not an act or a conveyance or transfer of the company (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `s 25(1) the act is invalid by reason only of the company's lack of capacity or power` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 25(2): where the lack of capacity or power may be asserted`

-- (a) a member's proceedings against the company to restrain an act: yes.
#ASSERT `s 25(2) the lack of capacity or power may be asserted or relied upon in the proceedings` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) a debenture holder or trustee, where the company has issued debentures secured by a floating charge over all or any of its property: yes.
#ASSERT `s 25(2) the lack of capacity or power may be asserted or relied upon in the proceedings` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) a debenture holder or trustee, but the debentures are not secured by a floating charge: not within (a); no other limb holds, so JUST FALSE ("only in").
#ASSERT `s 25(2) the lack of capacity or power may be asserted or relied upon in the proceedings` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b) proceedings by the company or a member against present or former officers: yes.
#ASSERT `s 25(2) the lack of capacity or power may be asserted or relied upon in the proceedings` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c) an application by the Minister to wind up the company: yes.
#ASSERT `s 25(2) the lack of capacity or power may be asserted or relied upon in the proceedings` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Any other proceedings (for example a creditor's action on the contract): the list is closed with "only", so JUST FALSE.
#ASSERT `s 25(2) the lack of capacity or power may be asserted or relied upon in the proceedings` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 25(3): the Court, the contract, and compensation`

-- All three gates met: the Court may set aside and restrain the performance of the contract.
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may set aside and restrain the performance of the contract` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not all the parties to the contract are parties to the proceedings: the "if" gate fails, NOTHING (the grant ruling).
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may set aside and restrain the performance of the contract` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The Court does not consider it just and equitable: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may set aside and restrain the performance of the contract` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The act sought to be restrained is not performed under a contract: the subsection is not engaged, NOTHING.
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may set aside and restrain the performance of the contract` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Compensation: the contract was set aside, claimant is the company or another party, loss may result from the Court's action.
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may allow the claimant compensation for the loss or damage` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may allow the claimant compensation for the loss or damage` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may allow the claimant compensation for the loss or damage` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may allow the claimant compensation for the loss or damage` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Anticipated profits "must not be awarded": JUST FALSE. Any other amount: the text is silent on the bar, NOTHING.
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may award the amount as a loss or damage sustained` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the Court may award the amount as a loss or damage sustained` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 25A: no constructive notice`

-- Registration by the Registrar is the only ground: the person is not affected and has no deemed notice (JUST FALSE).
#ASSERT `s 25A the person is affected by, or is deemed to have notice or knowledge of, the contents of the constitution or document` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Availability for inspection at the registered office is the only ground: JUST FALSE.
#ASSERT `s 25A the person is affected by, or is deemed to have notice or knowledge of, the contents of the constitution or document` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Both are grounds, and nothing else: JUST FALSE.
#ASSERT `s 25A the person is affected by, or is deemed to have notice or knowledge of, the contents of the constitution or document` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Some other ground (the person actually read the constitution): the section says nothing, NOTHING.
#ASSERT `s 25A the person is affected by, or is deemed to have notice or knowledge of, the contents of the constitution or document` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 25B(1) to (3): the directors' power to bind the company`

-- (3): a limitation deriving from a resolution, or from an agreement between members, is within the limitations under the constitution; any other source is not named (includes).
#ASSERT `s 25B(3) the limitation is within the limitations on the directors' powers under the company's constitution` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25B(3) the limitation is within the limitations on the directors' powers under the company's constitution` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25B(3) the limitation is within the limitations on the directors' powers under the company's constitution` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2)(b): presumed to have acted in good faith unless the contrary is proved.
#ASSERT `s 25B(2)(b) the person dealing with the company is presumed to have acted in good faith` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25B(2)(b) the person dealing with the company is presumed to have acted in good faith` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25B(2)(b) the person dealing with the company is presumed to have acted in good faith` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2)(a): not bound to enquire as to any limitation.
#ASSERT `s 25B(2)(a) the person dealing with the company is bound to enquire as to any limitation on the powers of the directors` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25B(2)(a) the person dealing with the company is bound to enquire as to any limitation on the powers of the directors` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1): a person dealing with the company, no proof of bad faith, a limitation under the constitution: the power is deemed free of the limitation.
#ASSERT `s 25B(1) the power of the directors to bind the company is deemed to be free of the limitation in favour of the person` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (1) with a limitation that derives from a resolution (s 25B(3)(a)) rather than from the constitution as such: still within (1).
#ASSERT `s 25B(1) the power of the directors to bind the company is deemed to be free of the limitation in favour of the person` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (1) with a limitation deriving from an agreement between members (s 25B(3)(b)).
#ASSERT `s 25B(1) the power of the directors to bind the company is deemed to be free of the limitation in favour of the person` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Bad faith is proved: the presumption falls away, so the deeming does not reach the person (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `s 25B(1) the power of the directors to bind the company is deemed to be free of the limitation in favour of the person` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The person is not dealing with the company (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `s 25B(1) the power of the directors to bind the company is deemed to be free of the limitation in favour of the person` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The limitation is not under the constitution and does not derive from a resolution or agreement: (1) speaks only of limitations under the constitution (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `s 25B(1) the power of the directors to bind the company is deemed to be free of the limitation in favour of the person` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 25B(4) to (6): the member's right, the liability, section 25C`

-- A member's proceedings to restrain an action beyond the directors' powers, the act not being in fulfilment of a legal obligation: the section does not affect the right (JUST FALSE).
#ASSERT `s 25B(4) section 25B affects the member's right to bring the proceedings` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- An act to be done in fulfilment of a legal obligation arising from a previous act: the "but" takes it out of the saving (NOTHING for this function).
#ASSERT `s 25B(4) section 25B affects the member's right to bring the proceedings` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not a member's proceedings to restrain an action beyond the directors' powers: the saving does not speak to it (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `s 25B(4) section 25B affects the member's right to bring the proceedings` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- "no such proceedings lie in respect of an act to be done in fulfilment of a legal obligation": JUST FALSE for the proceedings that lie.
#ASSERT `s 25B(4) the proceedings lie in respect of the act` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25B(4) the proceedings lie in respect of the act` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 25B(4) the proceedings lie in respect of the act` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5): the section does not affect the liability incurred by reason of the directors exceeding their powers.
#ASSERT `s 25B(5) section 25B affects the liability` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25B(5) section 25B affects the liability` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (6): subject to section 25C.
#ASSERT `s 25B(6) section 25B has effect subject to section 25C for the transaction` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25B(6) section 25B has effect subject to section 25C for the transaction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
